  savestate (and its PR #1864), so a saved state keeps the 3D engine's polygon
  mode, attributes and texture and the right polygon and vertex indices (state
  version 9.1; a 9.0 state still loads); and
  0006-radio-init-never-closes-a-descriptor-it-did-not-open.patch, ours, so a
  game turning the Wi-Fi radio on finds no link partners instead of the core
  closing a file descriptor it never opened.
  libretrodroid/cores/melonds/PINNED.txt records the commit, the patches and the
  hashes of the libraries that ship, and `python tools/cores/build_core.py melonds`
  builds them again from that source. The source of the core in the APK is that
  commit plus those patches; GPL-3.0 is this app's own license. Until rc34 the core
  was the libretro buildbot's nightly of 2026-09-07, of the same commit unpatched.
  Runs Platinum on its built-in FreeBIOS, so no Nintendo BIOS or firmware dump is
  required or bundled.

